      hu: ["A település 400 méterrel fekszik a tengerszint alatt.", "A várost a bibliai Coárral azonosítják.", "Szent Lót kolostora bizánci kori mozaikokat rejt.", "Ghor es-Safi Jordánia káliumgyártásának központja.", "Itt található a Föld legmélyebb pontjának múzeuma.", "A középkorban jelentős cukornádültetvények voltak itt."],
      ro: ["Ghor es-Safi este la 400 de metri sub nivelul mării.", "Orașul este asociat cu orașul biblic Zoar.", "Mănăstirea Sfântului Lot datează din secolul al V-lea.", "Este sediul companiei Arab Potash.", "Găzduiește Muzeul Celui Mai Jos Punct de pe Pământ.", "Zona a fost un centru major de producție a zahărului."],
      en: ["Ghor es-Safi is roughly 400 meters below sea level.", "It is traditionally identified as the biblical Zoar.", "The Sanctuary of Saint Lot features Byzantine mosaics.", "The town is home to the Arab Potash Company.", "It hosts the Museum of the Lowest Place on Earth.", "The area was a major sugar production center in the 7th century."],
