      hu: ["Deir Abi Saeed az Al-Koura közigazgatási körzet székhelye.", "A város tengerszint feletti magassága 350 és 400 méter között alakul.", "Al-Koura körzetben található Jordánia legsűrűbb olajfa-állománya.", "A települést 1922-ben, a brit mandátum idején jelölték ki közigazgatási központnak.", "A közelben fekvő Vádi Al-Rayan népszerű kirándulóhely a forrásai miatt.", "A régió híres a hagyományos módszerekkel előállított bio olívaolajról."],
      ro: ["Deir Abi Saeed este reședința oficială a districtului Al-Koura.", "Altitudinea orașului variază între 350 și 400 de metri deasupra mării.", "Districtul Al-Koura deține cea mai mare densitate de măslini din Iordania.", "Orașul a fost stabilit ca centru administrativ în anul 1922.", "Valea Wadi Al-Rayan din apropiere este celebră pentru peisajele sale verzi.", "Regiunea este un producător major de ulei de măsline extravirgin."],
      en: ["Deir Abi Saeed is the principal town of the Al-Koura administrative district.", "The town's elevation is approximately 350 to 400 meters above sea level.", "The Al-Koura district boasts the highest density of olive trees in all of Jordan.", "It was designated as an administrative center in 1922 during the British Mandate.", "The nearby Wadi Al-Rayan is a popular local destination for its springs.", "The region is renowned for its traditional and organic olive oil production."],
